assertions:
    assertion-rhaego-prophecy:
        subject:
            person: person-rhaego
        property: alias
        value: The Stallion Who Mounts the World
        confidence: high
        status: accepted
        citations:
            - citation-agot-daenerys-v
        notes: 'Source text: ''The prince is riding, and he shall be the stallion who mounts the world.'' The dosh khaleen prophesied that Rhaego would be the khal of khals, uniting all Dothraki into one khalasar and riding to the ends of the earth. The prophecy was unfulfilled as Rhaego was stillborn.'
